      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Vietnam is generally known for a more structured, focused approach to manufacturing, which can translate to predictable production timelines if you manage them correctly. Nigeria, on the other hand, has a much more fluid business environment where relationships and personal connections often matter more than strict adherence to schedules. You'll likely need a more hands-on, relationship-driven management style in Nigeria, while Vietnam might respond better to clear, process-oriented directives.",
      "source": "target",
